<title>USA: Bridgeport to buy back $2.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Bridgeport to buy back $2.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEPORT, Conn. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bridgeport Machines Inc said Tuesday it will buy back up to $2.5 million of its common stock from time to time in open market transactions.</p>
<p>The company said it will fund the purchases through cash from operations or credit facility borrowings.</p>
<p>Bridgeport currently has 5,695,000 shares outstanding, it said.</p>
